SUMMARY:BayCare Presents- Supplements Made Simple: A Family Doctor039\\\;s
  Guide
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:With so many vitamins\, minerals\, and herbal products on the 
 shelves\, choosing the right supplement can feel overwhelming. How do you 
 know which are helpful\, which are harmless but unnecessary\, and which co
 uld cause harm? In this talk\, a family physician will help make sense of 
 the options by reviewing commonly recommended supplements\, sharing tips f
 or choosing quality products\, and explaining how to avoid common mistakes
 . Youll leave with practical information to help you make more confident c
 hoices for your health. Register (https:events.teams.microsoft.comevent4cd
 6bc75-20be-4391-918f-f2934d407239599ceff3-02a8-45bc-baef-c48cb8be94c4) \n\
 nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196416
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196416
END:VEVENT
